18 months to seven months, largely because

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:58.320
of how our lives have shifted online.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:05.520
This research goes to exactly what I fear
when I get a phone call from someone who says

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:12.110
my cousin, my friend, my girlfriend in some
cases have been radicalized merely by the

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:16.300
