longer to have such a shift in ideology.

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.590
It's now happening really, really quickly.

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:31.760
And one of the real questions is the radicalization
is happening faster and faster.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:35.520
The deprogramming, I don't know that can really
